{"title":"SSC MTS 2022 Biology PART-4","slug":"ssc-mts-2022-biology-part-4","questions":[{"question":"The microorganisms which convert the dead plants and animals to humus are known as _________.","option_1":"autotrophs","option_2":"herbivores","option_3":"decomposers","option_4":"Producers","answer":"3","solution":""},{"question":"Fishes have ________ chambers of the heart.","option_1":"one","option_2":"three","option_3":"two","option_4":"four","answer":"3","solution":""},{"question":"________ are the vessels which carry carbon dioxide-rich blood back to the heart.","option_1":"veins","option_2":"arteries","option_3":"capillaries","option_4":"neurons","answer":"1","solution":""},{"question":"Which disease is caused by the deficiency of protein in the diet?","option_1":"Jaundice","option_2":"Scurvy","option_3":"Rickets","option_4":"Kwashiorkor","answer":"4","solution":""},{"question":"Snails is an example of which of the phylum of animal kingdom?","option_1":"Mollusca","option_2":"Annelida","option_3":"Protochordate","option_4":"Arthropoda","answer":"1","solution":""},{"question":"The blood platelets are also known as_______","option_1":"leucocytes","option_2":"thrombocytes","option_3":"erythrocytes","option_4":"thrombin","answer":"2","solution":""},{"question":"________ is the female reproductive part of the flower.","option_1":"anther","option_2":"filament","option_3":"sprouting","option_4":"pistil","answer":"4","solution":""},{"question":"The disease-causing microbes are called ____________.","option_1":"pathogens","option_2":"toxins","option_3":"decomposers","option_4":"antibodies","answer":"1","solution":""},{"question":"“Goitre” is a disease of which of the following glands?","option_1":"Thyroid gland","option_2":"Pituitary gland","option_3":"Adrenal gland","option_4":"Pancreas","answer":"1","solution":""},{"question":"Which class of algae is commonly known as green algae?","option_1":"Rhodophyceae","option_2":"Chlorophyceae","option_3":"Phaeophyceae","option_4":"Desmids","answer":"2","solution":""}]}